{"login": "phamthangph13", "location": "Viet Nam", "commits": [{"sha": "c3aa778e0c397668022c8560bbc447d3d768410b", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-03-21T15:34:15Z", "repo": "-medical-treatment-with-Assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "87a37447272c198a022af1a35cb3135dd2f169c9", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-03-21T15:32:18Z", "repo": "-medical-treatment-with-Assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fccdcb026e594c1279815d52994d3c23c1bddf56", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-03-21T15:26:20Z", "repo": "-medical-treatment-with-Assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ee0e6cda107fc60a370d304ac0622aedabd9a53d", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2024-03-21T14:44:44Z", "repo": "-medical-treatment-with-Assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5eeeb1338e47a16ecddc86964b050e1b30c067ff", "message": "Create Readme.md\n\nTutorial how to setup Doune Token", "created_at": "2024-04-01T02:16:18Z", "repo": "Doune-Ctypto", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0fa0c6a9e4d3627b849180f04bb027b1b1d7332a", "message": "Create DouneToken.sol\n\n\r\nThe provided Solidity smart contract implements the ERC-20 standard for a token named \"Doune\". Here's an overview of its functionalities:\r\n\r\nToken Balances: The contract maintains a mapping of token balances for each address using the balances mapping.\r\nAllowances: It also keeps track of allowances, allowing addresses to approve other addresses to spend tokens on their behalf, using the allowance mapping.\r\nTotal Supply: The total supply of tokens is fixed at 13,000,000, specified by the totalSupply variable.\r\nToken Information: The token has a name (\"Doune\"), symbol (\"DNE\"), and decimals (18), which are specified by the name, symbol, and decimals variables, respectively.\r\nEvents: Events are emitted for transfers and approvals, which helps in tracking token movements and approvals.\r\nContract Initialization: Upon deployment, the constructor initializes the contract by allocating the total token supply to the address that deployed the contract.\r\nOverall, this contract provides the basic functionalities required by the ERC-20 standard, enabling token transfers, balance inquiries, and approval mechanisms. If you have any specific questions about the contract or need further clarification on its functionalities, feel free to ask!", "created_at": "2024-04-01T02:14:08Z", "repo": "Doune-Ctypto", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1a64377f1b201122c52d69cf37e8d7461946d567", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-06-25T07:54:49Z", "repo": "Secure-Authentication-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff2f732cd572ae914e9ca2e056eedeb3e1df73d2", "message": "README.md", "created_at": "2024-06-25T07:34:51Z", "repo": "Secure-Authentication-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7b037b97a2ef6940198dc20692c5ceafd5bfbab4", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-06-25T07:32:34Z", "repo": "Secure-Authentication-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c10cc79ac792e51de25561a42c6a00ce35a3777a", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2024-06-25T07:32:06Z", "repo": "Secure-Authentication-System", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2af104440fe82438ace6c81a10affdfb2972390d", "message": "Update API.py", "created_at": "2024-09-18T07:25:20Z", "repo": "Heart-Disease-Prediction-App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b690a7420036aec1ac606cb0f1ee71de414f7fc2", "message": "Update README.md", "cre